{{Story page tab}}
Since the [[Dissociative Recombination]] (CN)/[[When Elegies Are Ashes]] (Global) update, [[Main Theme]] episodes, [[Intermezzi]], [[Side Stories]], and [[Story Collection]]s are now grouped into categories named '''Movements''' under the '''Score''' menu of the [[Terminal]], which functions identically to [[wikipedia:Story arc|story arcs]].

Some Movements contain ongoing storylines revolving around a central faction, e.g. Snow and Silver Steel revolving around [[Kjerag]], and Through the Ages focusing on [[Sui]] and [[Yan]]; on the other hand, Summertime Beats is simply a series of stand-alone stories taking place in summer, and Tales of Terra encompasses most [[Story Collection]]s, other stand-alone stories, and stories that do not fit neatly into other Movements. The Main Theme is considered its own Movement as well.

