==Trivia==
{{Trivia notice}}
*Movements have their own two-letter abbreviations that refer to the faction they focus on. For example, The Ark focuses on the members of <u>R</u>hodes <u>I</u>sland.
**The exceptions are <u>S</u>ummer<u>t</u>ime Beats and Tales of Terra, which do not focus on any particular faction; Tales of Terra's abbreviation, TS, may stand for <u>T</u>erran <u>S</u>tories instead.
**Initially, Movement abbreviations were color-coded. Following the [[Abnormal Spectrum]] (CN)/[[Somniloquium Serenum]] (Global) update, Movement abbreviations have received ornate but colorless icons.
*[[Ancient Forge]] is the only event themed around the Chinese New Year; its release in the CN and TW servers align with the holiday in 2020 and 2021, respectively. However, it is released in Global on July 2020 due to Global's scheduling differences with CN (see [[Event#Trivia]]).
*While most of the Movements show their constituent events in chronological order, with The Ark being a notable exception, few events are ever entirely clear about their exact dates, and the Score makes little indication as to continuity between different movements. Nevertheless, in-story allusions to past events have been clear enough and consistent enough for a [[Arknights Timeline|timeline]] to be worked out.

